And Gedaliah the son of Ahikam the son of Shaphan swore to them and to their men, saying, Don't be afraid to serve the Chaldeans: dwell in the land, and serve the king of Babylon, and it will be well with you

          {+}
        .

As for me, look, I will dwell at Mizpah, to stand before the Chaldeans that will come to us: but you

          {+}
        , gather

          {+}
         wine and summer fruits and oil, and put them in your

          {+}
         vessels, and dwell in your

          {+}
         cities that you

          {+}
         have taken.
